{"src":"ru","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":213700,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ru","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":10501.346273,"text":"В 1990 году он был добавлен в список всемирного наследия, находящегося под угрозой из-за опасности со стороны песков в пустыне."},{"kind":"text","t":10942.934937,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the List of World Heritage in Danger due to the threat from desert sands."},{"kind":"audio","t":11004.728545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11006.092843,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11007.503691,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11009.019930999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11010.677065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11011.835588,"samples":25160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":24549.910524,"text":"Если вы смотрели фильм «Сокровища нации», то можете подумать, что на оборотной стороне Декларации независимости была изображена карта сокровищ."},{"kind":"text","t":25079.181205,"text":"If you've seen the movie \"National Treasure,\" you might think that there was a treasure map depicted on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":25140.446883,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25141.683648,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25143.367452,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25145.067016,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25146.642218,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25148.286221,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25149.393303,"samples":25392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":36425.758495,"text":"Тети передаются под опеку по множеству разнообразных причин. От беспризорности до жестокого обращения и даже вымогательств."},{"kind":"text","t":36704.386951,"text":"Aunts are placed under guardianship for a wide variety of reasons. From neglect to abuse and even extortion."},{"kind":"audio","t":36758.855553,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36760.279512,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36761.94293500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36762.527137000005,"samples":18696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":230},{"kind":"audio","t":36798.1318,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36799.831695,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36800.328765000006,"samples":16064,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":45720.830663,"text":"Долина Качама – главное направление в Чире для альпинизма. Она известна как Йосмит Южной Америки и имеет большое количество..."},{"kind":"text","t":46044.536933,"text":"Kachama Valley is the main destination for mountaineering in Chire. It is known as the Yosemite of South America and has a large number of..."},{"kind":"audio","t":46099.486225,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":46101.03122600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46102.709969,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46103.977035,"samples":27096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"audio","t":46128.897834,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46130.41355500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46132.283152,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46133.759632,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":830},{"kind":"audio","t":46133.874704,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":48899.78268800001,"text":"больших гранитных стен и скал."},{"kind":"text","t":49048.686674000004,"text":"large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":49098.214777,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49099.718687,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":49100.042623,"samples":1064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":57763.485589,"text":"Во всех научных вопросах, включая психологию, были приняты взгляды Аристотеля."},{"kind":"text","t":58049.833150000006,"text":"Aristotle's views were adopted in all scientific matters, including psychology."},{"kind":"audio","t":58104.874334,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58106.32352300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58107.874614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":58109.479056000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":58109.868924,"samples":12928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":68122.867717,"text":"Если вы не привыкли ездить по сельским дорогам, будьте начеку. Преобладают крутые склоны, узкие переулки и резкие повороты."},{"kind":"text","t":68395.56660399999,"text":"If you are not used to driving on country roads, stay alert. Steep slopes, narrow alleys, and sharp turns predominate."},{"kind":"audio","t":68449.71629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68451.392364,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68452.97964599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":68453.17556999999,"samples":10296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":68488.48056699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68489.91941599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68491.532278,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":68491.63553099999,"samples":4296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":77266.791894,"text":"Наличие настоящей невидимой команды. Ларсон и Лафаста, 1989 год, страница 109."},{"kind":"text","t":77610.73612,"text":"The presence of a real invisible team. Larson and Lafasta, 1989, page 109."},{"kind":"audio","t":77662.198542,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77663.691192,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":77664.169402,"samples":15464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"audio","t":77699.343547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77700.898988,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77702.535571,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77703.645633,"samples":25896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":81717.50136699999,"text":"также является уникальным компонентом виртуальной команды."},{"kind":"text","t":81925.265842,"text":"is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":81975.98881899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81977.40037799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81978.614002,"samples":28064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":87142.107186,"text":"После несчастного случая Гибсон был доставлен в больницу, но вскоре скончался."},{"kind":"text","t":87443.379257,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to the hospital, but died shortly after."},{"kind":"audio","t":87500.19129599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87501.42061999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87503.075293,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87504.679336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":87504.88476,"samples":11728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":97871.106625,"text":"В немецкой выпечке часто используются миндаль, фундук и другие древесные орехи. Зачастую популярные торты отлично сочетаются с чашкой крепкого кофе."},{"kind":"text","t":98179.920356,"text":"Almonds, hazelnuts, and other tree nuts are often used in German pastries. Popular cakes often pair perfectly with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":98236.95044999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98238.438079,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98240.048002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98241.701365,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":98242.107473,"samples":13528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":98275.708537,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":98277.243278,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98278.89360099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98279.75143799999,"samples":21696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":104688.5656,"text":"Очевидно, что если владеешь языком романской подгруппы, тебе будет проще выучить португальский."},{"kind":"text","t":105045.998576,"text":"Obviously, if you know a Romance language, it will be easier for you to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":105102.60075099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105104.170722,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105105.785695,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105107.457428,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105108.361546,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":113914.521473,"text":"Звуковое и световое шоу на фоне пирамиды является одним из самых интересных мероприятий в этой местности для детей."},{"kind":"text","t":114343.633196,"text":"The sound and light show against the backdrop of the pyramid is one of the most interesting activities for children in this area."},{"kind":"audio","t":114403.897655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114405.420675,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114407.035597,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":114408.64723999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114410.32173299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114412.024998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1010},{"kind":"audio","t":114412.12333999999,"samples":6192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":123625.036911,"text":"Изучение движения отдельных водителей и автомобилей между двумя точками и их взаимодействия друг с другом осуществляется в рамках исследования транспортных потоков."},{"kind":"text","t":124137.72795999999,"text":"The study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and their interaction with one another is carried out as part of traffic flow research."},{"kind":"audio","t":124203.161862,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124205.736614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124207.382497,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124208.977549,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":930},{"kind":"audio","t":124210.633002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124212.33134599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124214.089431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124215.853597,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":124215.981139,"samples":6656,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":131905.93570600002,"text":"Австралиец Митчелл Гурли пришел к финишу 11 в соревнованиях по супергиганту для мужчин в классе стоя."},{"kind":"text","t":132279.409334,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley finished 11th in the men's super-G standing class."},{"kind":"audio","t":132334.56379000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132336.107121,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132337.78400400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132339.52394900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":132339.62499100002,"samples":3328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":139092.718276,"text":"Чех Олдрич Еленек пришел к финишу 16 в соревнованиях по супергиганту для мужчин в классе сидя."},{"kind":"text","t":139467.261065,"text":"Czech Aldrich Jelének finished 16th in the men's super-G sitting class."},{"kind":"audio","t":139521.853169,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139523.410391,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139524.998083,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139525.967802,"samples":25296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":151971.438633,"text":"Гаитянский институт справедливости и демократии сослался на независимое исследование, которое предполагает, что в России есть несколько стран, которые не имеют права на право на действие."},{"kind":"text","t":152520.90370000002,"text":"The Haitian Institute of Justice and Democracy cited an independent study suggesting that there are several countries in Russia that do not have the right to the right of action."},{"kind":"audio","t":152586.26779,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152588.02616500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152589.821411,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152591.34302200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152593.02090600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152594.69002900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152596.314412,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152597.978485,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152599.73997000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":830},{"kind":"audio","t":152599.83465200002,"samples":3288,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":152765.17836700001,"text":"что непальский миротворческий батальон ООН непреднамеренно завез заболевание в Гаити."},{"kind":"text","t":153042.94954600002,"text":"that a Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion unintentionally brought the disease to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":153097.950699,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153099.535301,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153101.16762400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153102.845417,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153104.071822,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":159357.212743,"text":"Вскоре после начала военных действий Британия устроила морскую блокаду Германии."},{"kind":"text","t":159647.904301,"text":"Shortly after the start of hostilities, Britain established a naval blockade of Germany."},{"kind":"audio","t":159704.888194,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159706.39701400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":159707.991046,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159709.639669,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159710.423535,"samples":24328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":168724.809695,"text":"Он также атаковал все, что входило в воду. Даже гигантский динозавр, такой как тираннозавр, не сравнился бы с ним."},{"kind":"text","t":169078.086718,"text":"He also attacked everything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur, such as a Tyrannosaurus, would not compare to it."},{"kind":"audio","t":169119.05652900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":169120.915807,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169121.745933,"samples":22064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"audio","t":169161.298516,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169162.770656,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169164.36263800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169165.732135,"samples":30096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":178179.73924700002,"text":"Использование видеозаписи привело к важным открытиям в сфере интерпретации микровыражений."},{"kind":"text","t":178503.93138700002,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important discoveries in the field of microexpression interpretation."},{"kind":"audio","t":178562.64323400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178564.02773200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178565.63807400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178567.253567,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178568.89907,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178569.92293,"samples":23960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":182408.191774,"text":"Движение лица длительностью несколько миллисекунд."},{"kind":"text","t":182586.592041,"text":"Facial movements lasting a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":182637.580733,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":182639.06743300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":182640.138924,"samples":25064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":192702.835723,"text":"Заявление было сделано после того, как Трамп провел телефонный разговор с президентом Турции Реджипом Таипом Эрдоганом."},{"kind":"text","t":193020.954471,"text":"The statement was made after Trump held a phone call with Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdoğan."},{"kind":"audio","t":193078.44339300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":193079.902493,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":193081.433903,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":193083.05679600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":193084.78383,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":193084.88795200002,"samples":4760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":202310.34572500002,"text":"Это иногда переполнено народом семейные пляжи с хорошим выбором магазинов, расположенных вдоль берега. Плавать безопасно."},{"kind":"text","t":202711.11715,"text":"These family beaches are sometimes crowded and have a good selection of shops located along the shore. Swimming is safe."},{"kind":"audio","t":202771.926049,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202773.487521,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202775.062362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202776.799407,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202778.479131,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":202778.57775300002,"samples":7760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":202808.204467,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202808.52377300002,"samples":12832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":212546.071354,"text":"Почти все более мелкие острова являются независимыми государствами или ассоциированы с Францией и известны как шикарные пляжные курорты."},{"kind":"text","t":212936.84601900002,"text":"Almost all of the smaller islands are independent states or associated with France and are known as glamorous beach resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":212998.31658100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212999.907103,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213001.475624,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":213003.111157,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213004.82816200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213006.503115,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213007.435994,"samples":22992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":410},{"kind":"close","t":223805.499714,"code":1005}]}